1. Grant of license

ForestWatch original source code in this distribution (the "Software") is
licensed, not sold. Third-party libraries, fonts, datasets, trademarks, and
external provider APIs are not licensed by this document.

A separate written order, invoice, or license certificate identifies which
tier applies: Developer, Commercial, Agency/Customization, or Exclusive
Acquisition.

Unless a written agreement says otherwise:

  (a) Developer. You may install and modify the Software for evaluation,
      development, and non-production use by the licensed seats or
      organization. You may not use the Software in production. You may not
      redistribute the Software.

  (b) Commercial. You may install, modify, and operate the Software in
      production for the licensed organization's internal use. You may not
      redistribute the Software. You may not resell, sublicense, or publish
      the Software as a competing ForestWatch source package.

  (c) Agency / Customization. You may customize the Software and deploy it
      for named clients identified in the license, including white-label
      presentation, subject to this license and any named-client schedule.
      Copyright in the original Software remains with the licensor unless a
      separate written assignment says otherwise. You may not redistribute
      the Software as an unconstrained source package.

  (d) Exclusive Acquisition. Assignment of original ForestWatch intellectual
      property, repository transfer, and escrow, if any, are governed only by
      a negotiated purchase agreement. That agreement does not transfer
      third-party libraries, datasets, trademarks, or external provider rights.

2. What this license does not grant

This license does not grant rights in:

  - FastAPI, React, MongoDB, Leaflet, or other third-party software
  - Copernicus / CORINE derived data, NASA FIRMS, Global Forest Watch, EEA,
    Copernicus EMS / EFFIS, Open-Meteo, or other provider datasets
  - Google Fonts or other third-party typefaces
  - Stripe, NASA, GFW, EEA, or other operator accounts, API keys, or trademarks
  - The right to present ForestWatch output as legal proof of illegal activity
    or as a government-certified monitoring system

See NOTICE and docs/packaging/third-party-notices.md.

